  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">그 다음으로 이어 이론을 바탕으로 한 표현해보기 영역에 관한 내용입니다. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기초 수업계획서는 </span><a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/250\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/250</span></u></a><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 있네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">....</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">표현하기 영역은 총 10차시로 구성을 하였습니다. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1, 2차시 : 표현하기 영영역의 주제 설정하기(선택과제)와 스토리보드에 계획과 준비물 정리</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 표현주제는 교사가 13개정도를 주고, 자유주제를 설정할 수 있게 자유로움을 주었습니다</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 핸드폰과 교과서 자료, 잡지를 사용하게끔 하였음.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3차시~5차시 : 계획서를 통과한 후 직접 제작해보기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 계획서를 통과한 모듬은 제작을 하는 시간을 갖음.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6차시 : 1차 제작발표회 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 각 모듬의 주제와 기획의도, 진척률을 공유함으로서 서로의 주제를 살펴보고, 진척률을 보면서 자극제 역할을 함.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7차시~8차시 : 수정보완하여 제작하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9차시~10차시 : 서클형식의 발표와 질문(10분)과 상호평가를 함.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">11차시 : 이 프로젝트의 평가회를 갖음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1. 프로젝트 주제설정</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/26276A36558C197028\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"573\" height=\"584\" style=\"width: 573px; height: 584px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"446\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"프로젝트 주제설정.jpg\"  id=\"A_26276A36558C1970286F8D\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. 프로젝트 스토리보드구성하기</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/226F563C558C19AA0F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"938\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"938\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"스토리보드1.jpg\"  id=\"A_226F563C558C19AA0F8D8A\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/245BD93C558C19CF1A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"518\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"518\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"스토리보드2.jpg\"  id=\"A_245BD93C558C19CF1A7768\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. 프로젝트 제작 실행하기</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2579E237558C1C0B08\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"400\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150605_113351.jpg\"  id=\"A_2579E237558C1C0B089F13\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/235AB737558C1C0B1B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"400\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150605_113329.jpg\"  id=\"A_235AB737558C1C0B1B750F\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2135DA37558C1C0D30\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"400\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150605_104052.jpg\"  id=\"A_2135DA37558C1C0D30323F\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24629437558C1C0E17\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"400\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150618_133405.jpg\"  id=\"A_24629437558C1C0E173855\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2752E737558C1C1120\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"400\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150602_141112.jpg\"  id=\"A_2752E737558C1C1120B229\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong></strong></sp